s=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MAKE CASH FAST. SABOTAGE YOUR FRIENDS. CLEAR YOUR DEBT. KEEP GAMBLING</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/5e5760988487c78466bf9906f44686f5.poster.avif?t=1778184257\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/5e5760988487c78466bf9906f44686f5.webm?t=1778184257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/5e5760988487c78466bf9906f44686f5.mp4?t=1778184257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
